233795,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"rXWplIEwKSytm1Kt","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[{"id":"gbB24uGtL3qWoZeQ","type":"text"}],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text","version":1,"versionNonce":887703881,"isDeleted":false,"id":"gbB24uGtL3qWoZeQ","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.5,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":30.0,"y":699.85,"strokeColor":"#0F172A","backgroundColor":"transparent","width":760.0,"height":105.30000000000001,"seed":852187576,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"rXWplIEwKSytm1Kt","roundness":null,"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false,"fontSize":13,"fontFamily":2,"text":"CLÁUSULA DE RESULTADOS ICFES (SIN GARANTÍAS ILÍCITAS):\n\n• SEAMOSGENIOS ofrece preparación pedagógica de alto nivel.\n• El puntaje final depende del esfuerzo y estudio individual del alumno.\n• Los puntajes de simulacros son herramientas de entrenamiento, no resultados oficiales.\n• Queda expresamente prohibido garantizar puntajes específicos o cupos universitarios.","textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","containerId":"HVH2Nmj2FtvcscXv","originalText":"CLÁUSULA DE RESULTADOS ICFES (SIN GARANTÍAS ILÍCITAS):\n\n• SEAMOSGENIOS ofrece preparación pedagógica de alto nivel.\n• El puntaje final depende del esfuerzo y estudio individual del alumno.\n• Los puntajes de simulacros son herramientas de entrenamiento, no resultados oficiales.\n• Queda expresamente prohibido garantizar puntajes específicos o cupos universitarios.","lineHeight":1.25,"baseline":13,"autoResize":true},{"type":"rectangle","version":1,"versionNonce":2130045562,"isDeleted":false,"id":"BBss5ExeosCcLbC7","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1.0,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0.0,"x":915.0,"y":120.0,"strokeColor":"#CBD5E1","backgroundColor":"#FFFFFF","width":860.0,"height":760.0,"seed":1102539861,"groupIds":[],"frameId":"rXWplIEwKSytm1Kt","roundness":{"type":3},"boundElements":[],"updated":1,"link":null,"locked":false},{"type":"text",